      "<div class=\"EV\"><img src=\"/Assets/wil4.jpg\" alt=\"letter1\" ></div><br>",
      "His talent has given him opportunities to sketch and present portraits to notable personalities and artists, including The Ashanti Regional Minister, Dr. Frank Amoakohene ,Kwadwo Nkansah, Gyakie and Odehyieba Priscilla during events such as the Ashanti High School Music Fiesta.",
      "These experiences have allowed Wilavis to combine his artistic abilities with live entertainment, creating memorable moments for both personalities and audiences.",
      "## Connecting Art with Student Life",
